## SQ-EFX-07 | Caffeinated holds Phantom Bane; time since rest untouched, reset when it ends
@group A
@commands `/effect give <bot> farmersrespite:caffeinated 30 0`; `/data get entity <bot> ActiveEffects`; `/scoreboard objectives add rest minecraft.custom:minecraft.time_since_rest`, read it during and 2 s after the effect ends
@pass Phantom Bane present (hidden); rest score keeps rising during (not set to -24000), reads 0 right after Phantom Bane expires
@fails `PhantomBaneRules`, `CaffeinatedEffectMixin`
@from batches/r1031/a1_effects.qb
> scoreboard objectives add rest minecraft.custom:minecraft.time_since_rest
sleep 3
> scoreboard players get qe rest
> effect give qe farmersrespite:caffeinated 30 0
sleep 2
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
> scoreboard players get qe rest
sleep 31
> scoreboard players get qe rest
expect has the following entity data.*phantom_bane
look rest score: rises between the first two reads (not -24000), reads 0 (or a few ticks) right after the effect ends
> scoreboard objectives remove rest

## SQ-EFX-08 | oxidized copper armor poisons (interval 10 s, chance 1.0 in the scratch toml)
@group A
@commands Give the bot oxidized copper armor (`/give <bot> everythingcopper:copper_helmet{state:"oxidized"}`, all four pieces, equip); set `[copper_poisoning] intervalSeconds` 10, `jitterSeconds` 0, `chancePerPiece` 1.0 in the scratch config; wait 25 s
@pass Poison I, about 10 s (4 + 3 x 2); unoxidized armor: never
@fails `CopperPoisoningHandler` (persistent key `ce_copper_poison_roll`), `isOxidized` NBT check
@from batches/r1031/a1_effects.qb
> effect clear qe
> item replace entity qe armor.head with everythingcopper:copper_helmet{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.chest with everythingcopper:copper_chestplate{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.legs with everythingcopper:copper_leggings{state:"oxidized"}
> item replace entity qe armor.feet with everythingcopper:copper_boots{state:"oxidized"}
sleep 25
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
> effect clear qe
> item replace entity qe armor.head with everythingcopper:copper_helmet
> item replace entity qe armor.chest with everythingcopper:copper_chestplate
> item replace entity qe armor.legs with everythingcopper:copper_leggings
> item replace entity qe armor.feet with everythingcopper:copper_boots
sleep 25
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
expect has the following entity data.*Id: 19
look the first read has Poison (Id 19), Duration about 200 ticks (4 + 3 x 2 s); the second (unoxidized) read has no Poison ("Found no elements" or no Id 19)
> clear qe

